162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (The day of the Easter Event included some last minute rules checks, decorations, and Lite magic to make sure things went smoothly. At first the Event was supposed to be streamed by me while Lite played the Abbott to my Costello as we gave gifts \(giftgiftgift!\) to participants. It was a very last minute request by me to have most of the staff team join. it was really nice to have everyone riffing off each other and sharing in the event together. I feel like it brought us closer. It is always our goal for players to have a great time on the Titancraft and to help make a great community. So if you enjoyed any of our events, including this year's Easter District, please drop a thank you to a member of the Staff Team! Speaking as someone who has only recently joined the team, I now understand that this chaos makes everything run beautifully and I can't wait for next time.)
/E (The day of the Easter Event included some last minute rules checks, decorations, and Lite magic to make sure things went smoothly. At first the Event was supposed to be streamed by me while Lite played the Abbott to my Costello as we gave gifts \(giftgiftgift!\) to participants. It was a very last minute request by me to have most of the staff team join. it was really nice to have everyone riffing off each other and sharing in the event together. I feel like it brought us closer. It is always our goal for players to have a great time on the Titancraft and to help make a great community. So if you enjoyed any of our events, including this year's Easter District, please drop a thank you to a member of the Staff Team! Speaking as someone who has only recently joined the team, I now understand that this chaos makes everything run beautifully and I can't wait for next time.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
