/T (It starts long before the Easter District is open. We begin by brainstorming ideas and talking about what ideas worked \(or not\) from previous seasons. We knew we wanted to continue the tradition of the Easter Egg Decorating Contest. But where was the district going to go, what other activities did we want to have, when was )
