166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (Speaking of which, we made a really big blunder when choosing the time of the Easter Event. We wanted to give everyone enough time to build and be considerate of everyone's time during the holiday. "So let's do it the weekend after Easter," we thought. We knew Tango couldn't participate at all due to a busy schedule, but Lite and I were both free for a tour. It'll be fine, right? Hah! After we decided we would have the Easter event after the Easter holiday and announced it in #server-announcements, people reminded us that it was the same day as the Hermitcraft Gamers Outreach Stream! Oh, no! There was no way we could host an Easter event at the same time, so I am glad we were able to pivot to the day before Easter, a whole week sooner. This sudden change caused a lot of panic in the Staff Team! We suddenly had to make all of the decisions in a tighter time frame.)
/E (Speaking of which, we made a really big blunder when choosing the time of the Easter Event. We wanted to give everyone enough time to build and be considerate of everyone's time during the holiday. "So let's do it the weekend after Easter," we thought. We knew Tango couldn't participate at all due to a busy schedule, but Lite and I were both free for a tour. It'll be fine, right? Hah! After we decided we would have the Easter event after the Easter holiday and announced it in #server-announcements, people reminded us that it was the same day as the Hermitcraft Gamers Outreach Stream! Oh, no! There was no way we could host an Easter event at the same time, so I am glad we were able to pivot to the day before Easter, a whole week sooner. This sudden change caused a lot of panic in the Staff Team! We suddenly had to make all of the decisions in a tighter time frame.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
