/T (I then proceeded to find an area in the Entertainment District that would be big enough to house all the games. Once a large enough area was found, it was marked with ZITS colored concrete and mapped out. I think I proceeded to decide the layout & game order in graph paper as well as in game with cyan carpet & signs to assign locations of each game so the game makers could work to their leisure.)
