/T (Some games went up immediately, shout out Wired & Phroday while others had things like builders block and finicky redstone cause some delays. But we eventually got everything built and then play testing began. One year after the initial kick off, the ZITS Group had a field day to do first round testing of the games with mods invited. Notes were given and applied to various Games and multiple rounds of secondary testing and )
