527 0 obj
<<
/Title (It starts long before the Easter District is open. We begin by brainstorming ideas and talking about what ideas worked \(or not\) from previous seasons. We knew we wanted to continue the tradition of the Easter Egg Decorating Contest. But where was the district going to go, what other activities did we want to have, when was)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 512 0 R
/Prev 519 0 R
/Next 531 0 R
>>
endobj
528 0 obj
<<
/Title (Speaking of which, we made a really big blunder when choosing the time of the Easter Event. We wanted to give everyone enough time to build and be considerate of everyone's time during the holiday. "So let's do it the weekend after Easter," we thought. We knew Tango couldn't participate at all due to a busy schedule, but Lite and I were both free for a tour. It'll be fine, right? Hah! After we decided we would have the Easter event after the Easter holiday and announced it in #server-announcements, people reminded us that it was the same day as the Hermitcraft Gamers Outreach Stream! Oh, no! There was no way we could host an Easter event at the same time, so I am glad we were able to pivot to the day before Easter, a whole week sooner. This sudden change caused a lot of panic in the Staff Team! We suddenly had to make all of the decisions in a tighter time frame.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 512 0 R
/Prev 531 0 R
/Next 520 0 R
>>
endobj
